    "overview": "A strong day to prepare, and your best energy arrives late in the evening. Moon sits in Cancer, your own sign, in Pushya nakshatra, which brings a steady, nurturing quality. You feel more yourself, and others read you as calm and credible. Sadhya yoga means accomplishable: goals within reach, a moderate positive. You are in the Moon/Mars period, and with Moon and Mars together in your self zone, confidence is high. Jupiter has just moved into your money zone, which supports talking about pay. Your interview is on 3 November, two days away, and you said you are thinking of changing jobs, so use today for rehearsal, not for deciding. Day score is 63.\n\nYOUR STRATEGY:\n1. Best window: 19:00–20:00, Labh choghadiya, score 91. Labh means gain. Run a full mock interview aloud, timed, with your top three stories.\n2. Avoid: 17:00–18:00, score 29. Do not make calls or commitments then.\n3. Rahu Kaal: 16:24–17:52. Stop all important decisions and sending during this window.\n\nYour single best move is to research the new company for 40 minutes at 11:00–12:00 (Amrit, score 88), then write five questions to ask them, including one about pay range.\n\nPut work and money in 11:00–12:00 (Jupiter hour), and keep 16:24–17:52 for routine tasks."
